      <h1 class="page-title">A cabinet maker who lets his work speak for itself</h1>
      <p class="lede">Joel Dyter has worked as a joiner and cabinet maker for more than {{ site.yearsTrade }} years, and has run his own business since {{ site.established }}, first from a workshop in Old Town and now from Unit 7 on the Pennine Industrial Estate in Hebden Bridge.</p>
